      "content": "it's just hard to get an appointment right now and i really don't want to miss out on these nutrition benefits while i wait. if i just keep my spinach intake pretty consistent every single day so there aren't any big surprises, am i basically fine to just go for it? it's just a bunch of leaves, i don't feel like it's that big of a deal.",
